{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.975,"lines":[{"text":"Les hommes bâtissent des pyramides de fumée...","t":2.8,"e":4.5,"w":[["Les",2.8,2.94],["hommes",2.96,3.12],["bâtissent",3.14,3.44],["des",3.46,3.58],["pyramides",3.6,4.02],["de",4.06,4.14],["fumée",4.22,4.5]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ils vendent de la lumière, mais leurs couloirs sont obscurs.","t":6.54,"e":10.04,"w":[["Ils",6.54,6.66],["vendent",6.7,6.86],["de",6.9,6.96],["la",7,7.06],["lumière",7.1,7.48],["mais",8.76,8.82],["leurs",8.84,9],["couloirs",9.04,9.34],["sont",9.4,9.54],["obscurs",9.58,10.04]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Quand le César moderne réclame sa part d'ombre,","t":12.1,"e":14.18,"w":[["Quand",12.1,12.2],["le",12.24,12.3],["César",12.36,12.66],["moderne",12.72,13.04],["réclame",13.1,13.44],["sa",13.5,13.6],["part",13.66,13.84],["d'ombre",13.88,14.18]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Moi, je lève les yeux vers le Ciel.","t":16.88,"e":20.64,"w":[["Moi",16.88,17.06],["je",19.34,19.44],["lève",19.48,19.66],["les",19.68,19.82],["yeux",19.86,19.98],["vers",20.02,20.14],["le",20.16,20.26],["Ciel",20.34,20.64]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"On vit dans une arche où les loups portent le costard,","t":35.4,"e":38.22,"w":[["On",35.4,35.52],["vit",35.58,35.74],["dans",35.82,36.02],["une",36.06,36.24],["arche",36.3,36.5],["où",36.54,36.66],["les",36.7,36.86],["loups",36.9,37.08],["portent",37.14,37.38],["le",37.42,37.5],["costard",37.6,38.22]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Où la justice est une aveugle qu'on promène dans le noir.","t":38.34,"e":41.78,"w":[["Où",38.34,38.44],["la",38.5,38.64],["justice",38.72,39.16],["est",39.2,39.34],["une",39.46,39.6],["aveugle",39.68,40.2],["qu'on",40.28,40.42],["promène",40.48,41.04],["dans",41.08,41.18],["le",41.22,41.32],["noir",41.38,41.78]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"L'État est ce serpent qui te promet un Éden,","t":42.3,"e":45.34,"w":[["L'État",42.3,42.72],["est",42.76,42.88],["ce",42.94,43.08],["serpent",43.16,43.6],["qui",43.66,43.8],["te",43.86,44],["promet",44.08,44.54],["un",44.62,44.76],["Éden",44.86,4